# basePath Chapter5

::FirstContractOpenCh5 
@trigger    OnContractSelectOpen
@cutscene
@once 

{@PAL}      	Captain, I have another surprise for you! 
{@Player}   	Wait... finally someone else on my ship?
{@PAL}      	No! 
{@Player}   	Oh.
{@PAL}      	Instead of one contract, you now have... two!
{@PAL}      	Congratulations on achieving agency Captain! 
{@Player}   	...thanks P.A.L. 

::BeforeSupplyChainCh5
@trigger    OnOverarchingLoaded
@when       IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Research)
@cutscene 
@once 

{@Ovill}    	Hi Locke.
{@Ovill}    	I got a thrilling new update for the Forsch Sector!
{@Callie}   	I wouldn’t listen to him, my Clackey friend.
{@Ovill}    	How-how did you get this frequency?! This is an encrypted channel!
{@Ovill}    	Who are you?
{@Callie}   	Why, it is I...
{@Player}  	    Here we go... 
{@Callie}   	Callie Lee! The Space Pirate Queen of Velos Station! 
{@Callie}   	Trying to steal me business huh?
{@Ovill}    	Stealing- you stole a whole station from Frontier!
{@Callie}   	You seriously want to conduct business with this fool, Clackey? 
{@Player}   	My name is not Clackey. 
{@Ovill}    	Get OFF this frequency!
{@Callie}   	Seeesh! Okay I will! Don't forget to take some blood pressure meds. 
{@Callie}   	See you later, Clackey.
{@Ovill}   	    Hm-ph... sorry about that. 
{@Player}   	No worries. 
{@Ovill}    	...reach out if you want to do business. 

::AfterSupplyChain
@trigger	    OnOverarchingLoaded 
@when 	        IsSolutionFoundFor(Research), IsSolutionFoundFor(Design), IsSolutionFoundFor(Supply)
{@Player} 	    P.A.L., Fabrication is going to be… not glitched this time, right? 
{@PAL} 	        After much evaluation, I have a 97.1% certainty that all Frontier Fabrication Ships are in proper working order!
{@Player} 	    So Fabrication’s glitches are solved? 
{@PAL}	        That percentage is based on the Frontier Robotics Productivity Database, which estimates the effectiveness of all Frontier Robotics Fabrication Ships. 
{@Player} 	    Okay… what about my ship? 
{@PAL}	        Unfortunately, I can't determine that percentage right now. 
{@Player} 	    Of course. 
